# GMS's own figures: 200+8x% on three enemies. The summon's duration is
# dropped, as every duration here is -- the shuriken simply always hangs there.
#
# 968ms between pulses is `oleneyl/maplestory_dpm_calc`'s 60000/62: 62 strikes
# over the 60 seconds GMS gives it. The wiki states no rate for any summon, and
# this is the same file Phoenix, Frostprey and the Arrow Blaster turret are
# read from.
name: "Dark Flare"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Hang a great shuriken of dark energy beside you that strikes nearby "
  "enemies on its own."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERMIT
max_level: 20
max_enemies: 3
cast_interval_seconds: 0.968
base { skill_pct: 2.08 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.08 }
